  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  The spectra and nuclear modification factor, $R_{\\rm AA}$, of electron from heavy flavour hadron decays at mid-rapidity is measured in Pb--Pb collisions at 2.76 TeV with ALICE at the LHC in the transverse momentum intervals, $0.5<p_{\\rm T}<3$ GeV/$c$ and in two collision centrality classes (0-10% and 20-40%). A new pp reference at the same collision energy is measured.",
